"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (strong numeralwise representability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是递归可枚举的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>不是可判定的</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可强表示，则对输入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>并行搜索<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>对正实例和负实例的证明；表示性保证至少找到一个，相容性保证不会同时找到两个</li>\n<li>初等性使证明搜索有效，于是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>将可判定，与假设矛盾</li>\n<li>这是不完备性的集合论视角</li>\n<li>对满足相应有效性、相容性与算术强度的具体<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，其定理码集给出c.e.但不可判定的典型例子；这不是任意所谓“Gödel集”的无条件性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","stat